# React + Vite

- Functional components only; colocate CSS modules next to components.
- Routing via React Router (`/`, `/koans/:slug`) with Vite `base` for GitHub Pages.
- Progress: `ProgressProvider` + `lib/progress.ts` — never invent a parallel store.
- Prefer shared components (`InvestigatePanel`, `ChoiceQuestion`, `CodeBlank`, `LoopBack`) over one-off UI.
- No backend calls, no environment secrets in the client.
